  "front": [
    {
      "dialogue": "Daniel? How did you...",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "That day on the tennis courts - I saw how you handled those cheap shots and still won clean.",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "That's when I knew - when Scarlett Harrington sets her mind to something, she delivers.",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "That means more than you know.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Oh my god, you're the Daniel! What are you doing here?",
      "characterName": "Tiana",
      "characterImg": "result:f7lng9h5",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Last I checked, Grand Slam winners were allowed to eat macarons.",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "She didn't mean it like that.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Just teasing. My next stop's actually nearby - care to join me?",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "We'd love to.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_01.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "So this mysterious destination was your tennis court all along.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Yup, so better suit up before you play.",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Wait - are you challenging me to a match, Mr. Grand Slam?",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:q0w8e4r6",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "What's wrong? Intimidated by a washed-up pro?",
      "characterName": "Daniel",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_02.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Just give me five to change into my game face.",
